&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.seer.bio/uploads/2023/10/E-Verify_Participation_Poster.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;E-Verify Participation Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.seer.bio/uploads/2023/10/RightToWorkPoster.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Anti-Discrimination Notice/Right to Work&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
