&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Technical Success Manager to join our team. This is a hybrid role, reporting to the Manager of Technical Success in the [MISSING: INSERT DETAIL] department. You will guide customers through their Zero Trust journey as the central post-sales point of contact, helping them adopt and maximize their usage of Zscaler&#39;s solutions to secure their digital transformation objectives. Your role centers on providing expert advice, building relationships, and ensuring successful solution adoption for Zscaler’s customers.&lt;/p&gt;
